USCIS H-1B Employer Data Hub files. Drop .csv or .xlsx here; include the
fiscal year in the filename (e.g. H1B_FY2024.csv).

Source: https://www.uscis.gov/tools/reports-and-studies/h-1b-employer-data-hub

Recognized columns (see backend/h1b_engine/ingest/uscis_hub.py::COLUMN_MAP):
  Employer (Petitioner) Name, Tax ID, NAICS Code,
  Petitioner City, Petitioner State, Petitioner Zip Code,
  Initial Approval, Initial Denial, Continuing Approval, Continuing Denial,
  Line by Line, Fiscal Year

Run:  python scripts/ingest.py uscis-hub --fiscal-year 2024
